@InternApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5109

### 10連ガチャ
POST {{InternApi_HostAddress}}/api/gacha/draw
Content-Type: application/json

{ "gachaId": 1 }

### ユーザー作成
POST {{InternApi_HostAddress}}/api/user/create
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Dave" }

### ログイン (ダミー認証。name 一致だけで userId を返す)
POST {{InternApi_HostAddress}}/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Alice" }

### Debug: 所持品一覧
GET {{InternApi_HostAddress}}/api/debug/inventory?userId=1

### Debug: 所持数チェック
GET {{InternApi_HostAddress}}/api/debug/item-has-enough?userId=1&itemId=1001&requiredCount=3000

### Debug: アイテム付与
POST {{InternApi_HostAddress}}/api/debug/item-give?userId=1&itemId=1001&grantCount=3000

### Debug: アイテム消費
POST {{InternApi_HostAddress}}/api/debug/item-consume?userId=1&itemId=1001&consumeCount=300

### Debug: 単発抽選
POST {{InternApi_HostAddress}}/api/debug/gacha-draw-one?gachaId=1
